```java
@Transactional
public PlayoutDecisionRecordResponse submitReceipt(String playKey, SubmitReceiptRequest request) {
    // result 校验
    ReceiptResult result = parseResult(request.result()); // 非法 400
    String hash = sha256(OP_SUBMIT_RECEIPT + "|" + playKey + "|" + result + "|" + request.note());
    return idempotent(request.requestId(), OP_SUBMIT_RECEIPT, hash, PlayoutDecisionRecordResponse.class, () -> {
        DecisionRow decision = repo.findDecisionForUpdate(playKey)
                .orElseThrow(() -> ApiException.notFound("播出决定不存在: " + playKey));
        Optional<ReceiptRow> existing = repo.findReceipt(playKey);
        if (existing.isPresent()) {
            ReceiptRow receipt = existing.get();
            if (receipt.result().equals(result.name()) && receipt.note().equals(request.note())) {
                return toRecordResponse(decision, receipt);
            }
            throw ApiException.conflict("RECEIPT_CONFLICT", "该播出决定已有不同内容的回执: " + playKey);
        }
        long reportedAtMs = nowMs();
        try {
            repo.insertReceipt(playKey, result.name(), request.note(), request.requestId(), reportedAtMs);
        } catch (DuplicateKeyException e) {
            ReceiptRow committed = repo.findReceipt(playKey).orElseThrow(...);
            // 比较
        }
        return toRecordResponse(decision, new ReceiptRow(...));
    });
}
```

result 用 String 请求字段 + 手动解析（400）。note @NotBlank 校验（400）。但注意：Bean validation 在 controller 层 @Valid 时先执行，requestId/result/note 非空由 validation 保证。result 值合法性手动校验。

顺序问题：404（决定不存在）与 400（result 非法）哪个先？参数非法 400 优先比较合理。hash 计算需要 result，所以在 idempotent 之前解析 result → 400 优先。✓ 但 note 空由 @NotBlank 在 controller 层拦截。若直接调 service 层 note 空…… 测试走 API 层，OK。不过为稳妥，service 里也检查 note blank → 400。

